   300	## 2. Exact invariant on a completed generic coordinate fibre
   301	
   302	This section consumes the **PROVISIONAL** parent conclusion at
   303	`...poisson-locally-finite-obstruction...md:384-440`.  For a general value
   304	`a_f`, put
   305	
   306	```text
