+pole on `Cbar_h` at `p`, of order `M>0`, then
+
+```text
+ord_p((X_h|C_h)^j H)=-M-j e_p,                         (2.6)
+lc_p((X_h|C_h)^j H)
+ =(kappa/e_p)^j lc_p(H)
