+```text
+ord_p((X_h|C_h)^j H)=-M-j e_p,                         (2.6)
+lc_p((X_h|C_h)^j H)
+ =(kappa/e_p)^j lc_p(H)
+   product_(i=0)^(j-1)(-M-i e_p) != 0,
+```
+
+up to the harmless sign change coming from whether `h=f` or `g`.  Thus the
+orders are attained and the iterates are linearly independent.
+
+The existence of `p` did not follow from the phrase “total degree four”
