+
+## 7. Conclusions and typed open points
+
+The hidden premise is now discharged: for `h=f` and `h=g`,
+
+```text
+C(h)^alg intersect K=C(h),
+```
+
+where the algebraic closure is taken inside `K`.  Thus the general coordinate
