+route has supplied that place.
+
+## 6. Other surviving corrections
+
+At the interior companion over the target cusp, put
+
+```text
+p=f-f(u_c),                    q=g-g(u_c).
+```
+
+Etaleness gives the exact marked completion and fields
+
