+
+```text
+Y --rho--> W --(tau,id)--> A1_f x A1_g.
+```
+
+Finiteness of `rho` is elementary here: `O(Y)` is finite over `C[f,g]`, it
+contains `O(T_f)[g]`, and the same finite module generators work over the
